# Labeling runs (scripts/agent_label.py) are tracked, not ignored: picks.json, the raw
# labeler responses, merged.json, items.json, summary.json and the adjudicated
# review_queue.md are the provenance of every held-out Golden -- who labeled it, under
# which prompt and taxonomy, which fields a person decided and why. They hold public job
# postings and model output, no credentials. A run is ~900 KB.

# One ticket per branch (HIR-88). The pre-commit hook reads it; it never ships.
